"Be a  Washington Loglan Worker", a newsletter published by Bob LeChevalier in July and August 1986 as part of an attempt to create a Washington D.C. area ((Loglan)) special interest group (SIG). The newsletter was renamed to "((hoi loglypli))" in April 1987, and finally, in February 1988, to "((ju'i lobypli))".

* ((mw:me lu ju'i lobypli li'u 1 moi | Number 1 - July 1986))
* ((mw:me lu ju'i lobypli li'u 2 moi | Number 2 - August 1986))


